{"step_index":4251,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T23:19:42Z","thinking":"Observed that \"السلام شبين\" document lists \"زوفيراكس ٢٠٠مجم اقراص\" and \"زوفيراكس شراب\", but *not* \"زوفيراكس 400مجم اقراص.\" This discrepancy could indicate an omission or a data inconsistency. The warehouse inventory listing shows \"زوفيراكس ٢٠٠مجم اقراص/\". Confirming the absence of the 400mg tablets in the specified document is a critical step.\n\n\nExamined how the model incorrectly matched drug names, specifically \"زوفيراكس 400مجم\" with the 200mg version, indicating a potential hallucination or misinterpretation of the strength. Noticed the model fixed an OCR typo in another instance and incorrectly matched \"بالموكورت 25 مجم\" with \"بالمكيرت ربع\", highlighting the application's sensitivity to minor name variations and the need for more robust matching logic that incorporates units. The discrepancy in matching stemmed from the different representations of the same drug name within the data sources.\n\n\nExamining the Cure Pharma data, it's apparent that the model frequently simplifies detailed descriptions, often omitting information like the quantity of tablets or the presence of \"س ج\" (likely indicating \"new batch\" or a similar designation) in matches. The model appears to be prioritizing the core drug name and strength, potentially leading to information loss. Noted a significant disparity in the interpretation of \"كابرجامون 5مجم اقراص س ج\" being mapped to \"كابريجامون 0.5 جم 2قرص\", likely because of incorrectly inferring \"5\" = \"0.5\" due to similar writing.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import sys\\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\\nimport json\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom src.extract.excel_reader import read_excel, extract_item_names\\nfrom src.extract.pdf_reader import parse_structured_result\\nfrom src.fast_match.search import FastCandidateFinder\\n\\n# Shortages\\nshortages_file = Path(\\\"data/processes/PROC-001/input_shortages/0913.xlsx\\\")\\nshortage_rows = read_excel(shortages_file)\\nshortage_items = extract_item_names(shortage_rows, name_column=\\\"أسم الصنف\\\")\\n\\n# Cure Pharma\\nwh_file = Path(\\\"data/processes/PROC-001/input_warehouses/كيور فارما خاص.json\\\")\\nwith open(wh_file, \\\"r\\\", encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\") as f:\\n    cure_data = json.load(f)\\ncure_items = parse_structured_result(cure_data, \\\"كيور فارما خاص.pdf\\\")\\nwh_items_list = [{\\\"id\\\": f\\\"WH_{i:05}\\\", \\\"name\\\": item[\\\"item_name_raw\\\"]} for i, item in enumerate(cure_items)]\\n\\nfinder = FastCandidateFinder()\\nfinder.fit(wh_items_list)\\n\\ntest_names = [\\n    \\\"ترايملازما كريم س ج\\\",\\n    \\\"دولوكسبرين 30مجم 28قرص س ج\\\",\\n    \\\"ديكلوبرو150مجم 20قرص\\\",\\n    \\\"لاكسيول بي ملين اقراص\\\",\\n    \\\"لاكتيز 15 ملل نقط 750مجم\\\",\\n    \\\"فلوبادكس 8مجم اقراص\\\",\\n    \\\"نابيبرادين 7.5 مجم 30 قرص س ج\\\",\\n    \\\"زوكوزيت 20/10مجم اقراص\\\",\\n    \\\"فايركتا 3 شريط س ج\\\",\\n    \\\"سيفيتيل 1جم\\\",\\n    \\\"ميلجا ماكس30قرص\\\",\\n    \\\"نيفيلوب12.5/5مجم بلاس20قرص\\\",\\n    \\\"فيتا دي ثري4000ميكروفيلم\\\"\\n]\\n\\nprint(\\\"Checking candidate retrieval for items Gemini matched in Cure Pharma:\\\")\\nfor name in test_names:\\n    cands = finder.search(name, top_k=3)\\n    c_names = [c[\\\"name\\\"] for c in cands]\\n    print(f\\\"\\\\nReq: '{name}'\\\")\\n    print(f\\\"Cands ({len(cands)}): {c_names}\\\")\\n\"","Description":"\"Check candidate search for Cure Pharma items Gemini matched\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\scratch\\\\check_cure_gemini_items.py\"","toolAction":"\"Write script\"","toolSummary":"\"Check Cure Pharma candidate retrieval\""}}]}
